2026-06-09 14:24:22.570 [info] [Terminal] Executing command {"terminalId":5,"command":"python -c \"\nimport time\nfrom tests.performance.test_scalability import _create_travel_matrix, _create_engineers, _create_jobs\nfrom src.optimization.matching import assign_jobs\nfrom src.optimization.routing import find_optimal_route\n\ntm = _create_travel_matrix(30, min_travel=0.1, max_travel=0.5)\nengineers = _create_engineers(25, 30, working_hours=8.0, skill_variety='mixed')\njobs = _create_jobs(250, 30, length_range=(0.5, 1.5), skills_per_job=(1, 2))\n\nt0 = time.time()\nassignments, unassigned = assign_jobs(engineers, jobs, tm)\nt1 = time.time()\nprint(f'Matching: {t1-t0:.3f}s')\n\n# Now route each engineer individually\nfor eng in engineers:\n    assigned_jobs = assignments.get(eng.id, [])\n    if not assigned_jobs:\n        continue\n    locs = [j.location for j in assigned_jobs]\n    t2 = time.time()\n    route, dist = find_optimal_route(eng.location, locs, tm)\n    t3 = time.time()\n    if t3-t2 > 0.1:\n        print(f'  Engineer {eng.id}: {len(locs)} jobs, {t3-t2:.3f}s')\nprint(f'Routing all: {time.time()-t1:.3f}s')\nprint(f'Total: {time.time()-t0:.3f}s')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15000}
